{% comment %}
版心 banxin：右侧一条版心竖带（两条墨线夹住，上鱼尾），标题竖排在版心左边（朱雀仿宋、title 档，单处不超过 12 字，过长时均衡折成两列）；左边大片纸面上目录横排，行首两位等高数字（EB Garamond、lead 档，ink-3），条目宋体 400、lead 档，行距放宽、不画界栏，靠留白分行。
朱色：无。入场：版心与标题先出，条目自上而下错峰 line。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }

  .page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto var(--ds-space-6);
    column-gap: var(--ds-space-6);
    height: 100%;
  }
  .items {
    align-self: center;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: n;
    padding-left: var(--ds-space-7);
  }
  .items li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--ds-space-5);
    padding: var(--ds-space-3) 0;
    counter-increment: n;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .items li::before {
    content: counter(n, decimal-leading-zero);
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-latin);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-3);
  }
  .heading {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: upright;
    word-spacing: -.75em;
    max-height: 6.4em;
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-7);
    text-wrap: balance;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-title);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-latin), var(--ds-font-cjk-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .banxin {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--ds-space-3);
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-7);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
  }
  .yuwei { width: 28px; fill: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .banxin::after { content: ""; flex: 1; width: 1px; background: var(--ds-color-rule); }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <ol class="items" data-ds-stagger="line">
    {% for item in slots.items %}<li data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="{{ forloop.index | plus: 1 }}">{{ item }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <h1 class="heading" data-ds-enter="fall" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.heading }}</h1>
  <div class="banxin" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H24V10L17 5.5L12 11.5L7 5.5L0 10Z"/></svg></div>
</div>
